# The published test images build-image.sh pulls, by digest (#7664).
#
# `inputs` is the sha256 of the Dockerfile these images were built from. When it differs from the
# Dockerfile's, a CI leg pulls that Dockerfile's published tag with a warning, or builds when none
# is published. To move the pins after a Dockerfile change merges, copy the lines the
# host-test-image workflow's run summary prints, inputs line included. A site added to the matrix
# is pinned `-` until the publisher has run for it.
